      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eI think you are suggesting the tracehook to unset the WF_SYNC flag if its not honoring.\n\nYes, correct. Sorry for the ambiguity.\n\n\u003eThat is not possible, wake_flags is not passed in.\n\nMay I ask which trace hook is being used here? Both trace_android_rvh_enqueue_task and trace_android_rvh_select_task_rq_rt seem to pass in flags; I presume a different one is being used for this evaluation? I\u0027m just trying to better understand where this decision is being made.",
