      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e\u003e Can you have the hook set some state in p to indicate sync-flag override?\n\u003e\u003e You\u0027d also need a new hook in should_honor_rt_sync() to consume that state and return whether the sync flag is being honored.\n\nWe will need to worry about clearing that flag post enqueue.\n\nThe check here (patchset1) of simply ensuring the enq has indeed happened on the current cpu, (IOW wakeup was honored) is much simpler and less hacky to the task flag alternative.\n\nIf the concern is that something will break when load balancing enqueues, it will not becuase ENQUEUE_WAKEUP_SYNC is used only in the wakeup path not in load balancing path.",
